questions.question:
Consider the following C program segment utilizing the fork() system call:

```c
#include <stdio.h>
#include <unistd.h>

int main() {
    fork();
    if (fork() == 0) {
        fork();
    }
    return 0;
}
```

Including the initial parent process, what is the total number of processes created during the execution of this program?
